{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "Real published CVEs in popular PyPI packages. Every package installs from PyPI at run time with safe_pip_install; nothing third-party is vendored here. Entries whose oracle effect is implemented (canary_read, canary_write, canary_exec, canary_sql) run the normal loop on the vulnerable and the fixed version; entries with effect 'pending' document a real advisory for an effect the oracle cannot observe yet (ReDoS, reflected XSS) and are listed, never silently dropped.",
  "effects_implemented": ["canary_read", "canary_write", "canary_exec", "canary_sql"],
  "entries": [
